WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Jamie advances below the Level 3 launch at the corner.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.400
Rush crouching heavy catches Ryu.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.100
Standing light kick continues the juggle before the reset.

4
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:02.550
Ryu has landed and guards Drive Impact; the combo counter resets.

5
00:00:02.550 --> 00:00:03.450
The guarded Impact crushes Ryu against the corner.

6
00:00:03.450 --> 00:00:04.850
Ryu falls after the wall crush.
